        "TileImage": "$($repository 7dee2992-ae30-4186-a4ec-e46760931101).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon. \rYour targets are the lead engineers and crew of Rico Delgado&apos;s submarine. They can be found in the caves deep underneath the Delgado mansion, where they are at work. They leave tonight to rob a cargo ship carrying several Imperial Filigree Eggs and assassinate the captain, Sir Rutherford,  on board. Your task is to stop them in their tracks. \rGood luck.\r(Turn INSTINCT, NPC ICONS and the MINI-MAP off for the full experience!)",
